module Symplify.Components

#: The component library's inventory. Kept complete on purpose: nothing imports this
#: module by URI (`import "../components"` resolves by file name), so a missing entry
#: never complained — it had drifted to fifteen of twenty files, five of them the ones
#: the pages import most. `test_the_components_directory_and_its_qmldir_agree` holds
#: this list to the directory.

# CodeSurface is the box behind a code input, in the code theme's own colours.
CodeSurface 1.0 CodeSurface.qml
# CodeField / CodeArea are the two code inputs themselves — font, surface, ink, and the
# highlighter on the area's document — so the calculator's Assign row and the Variables
# editors cannot drift apart. Each page keeps its own keys.
CodeArea 1.0 CodeArea.qml
CodeField 1.0 CodeField.qml
# CodeContextMenu is the app's context menu for a text input, and the press that opens
# it: every code and text field gets one (Qt's own attached menu anchors to the caret,
# not to the pointer).
CodeContextMenu 1.0 CodeContextMenu.qml
# CommandBar is a row of `Action`s that folds what does not fit into an overflow menu
# (see the toolbar bullet under Rendering).
CommandBar 1.0 CommandBar.qml
# CopyableLabel is the read-only, borderless text box that reports a result — the
# calculator's outcome and a history card's lines. Selectable, never editable, and
# whole: the text is never truncated, the outer item clips it.
CopyableLabel 1.0 CopyableLabel.qml
# ExpanderPanel has no in-tree user yet; kept deliberately as the plain-Expander
# counterpart to ExpanderRow (same cursor fix) for future pages.
ExpanderPanel 1.0 ExpanderPanel.qml
ExpanderRow 1.0 ExpanderRow.qml
HScrollView 1.0 HScrollView.qml
# HistoryCard is one history card — the delegate the History page's Repeater builds
# (the page hands it `host` and `scroller`).
HistoryCard 1.0 HistoryCard.qml
KeyboardPanel 1.0 KeyboardPanel.qml
LatexImage 1.0 LatexImage.qml
# MathStrip is the formula area itself: HScrollView + LatexImage + the room the
# overlay bar needs. LatexImage is its inner renderer, not a page-level type.
MathStrip 1.0 MathStrip.qml
# MessageDialog is the one message box (title, wrapped body, buttons); WarningDialog is
# that plus the wiring to a viewmodel's `warningOccurred`.
MessageDialog 1.0 MessageDialog.qml
WarningDialog 1.0 WarningDialog.qml
# PageBody is a page's scrolling body: the inset, the attached bar and the height it
# scrolls to, in the one place all four scaffold pages share.
PageBody 1.0 PageBody.qml
PageHeader 1.0 PageHeader.qml
PageHeaderRow 1.0 PageHeaderRow.qml
PageScaffold 1.0 PageScaffold.qml
# RadioSettingRow is a `SettingItem` whose radio leads its own label — the shape a short
# list of choices takes, and the one bare `SettingItem` children cannot express (they
# land in the right-hand slot). `SettingRowBase` is the `SettingItem` both row shapes
# are built on, and RadioSettingGroup is the surface those rows sit on (they paint none
# of their own); SettingFieldRow is the label-over-full-width-control shape a text
# field needs.
SettingRowBase 1.0 SettingRowBase.qml
RadioSettingRow 1.0 RadioSettingRow.qml
RadioSettingGroup 1.0 RadioSettingGroup.qml
SettingFieldRow 1.0 SettingFieldRow.qml
SearchBar 1.0 SearchBar.qml
# ProjectFocusIndicator is the focus ring both shadows below use (the radius and the
# probe objectName live there once).
ProjectFocusIndicator 1.0 ProjectFocusIndicator.qml
SegmentedItem 1.0 SegmentedItem.qml
SelectorBarItem 1.0 SelectorBarItem.qml
# VariableCellEditor is the Variables table's inline cell editor (the view opens it
# on the edited cell; the delegate writes what it holds).
VariableCellEditor 1.0 VariableCellEditor.qml
# VariableDetailsPanel is the Variables page's details panel (the selected variable,
# its two fields and the row's actions); the page hands it `host`.
VariableDetailsPanel 1.0 VariableDetailsPanel.qml
# The Settings page's five sections, one component each: the page keeps the frame and
# the order, and a section keeps its own state (its label/value pairs) and its own dialog.
SettingsInterfaceSection 1.0 SettingsInterfaceSection.qml
SettingsWorkspaceSection 1.0 SettingsWorkspaceSection.qml
SettingsLanguageSection 1.0 SettingsLanguageSection.qml
SettingsFileSection 1.0 SettingsFileSection.qml
SettingsAboutSection 1.0 SettingsAboutSection.qml
# Tip is a `ToolTip` with the app's own manners: the delay every tip waits, and the
# control it is shown for.
Tip 1.0 Tip.qml
